+the production generator remains byte-identical at
+`4f45d334880485ba8e7926f352f6f9c919dad53df3a9b868af43703964dff4ec`.
+
+The first two demonstrations cover all four corner classes and reject the
+alternate direction plus eight executable shortcuts: identity, move instead of
+copy, opposite-corner copy, bounding-box fill, first-corner-only,
+largest-corner-only, ignore-singletons, and 8-connected components. The fourth
+query is a dense 30x30 scene, not padding: across the bounded stress sweep it has
+at least 80 foreground cells and at least 12 changed cells.
+
+The reusable `self_audit.py` passed 12 protected-Racket jobs and 138 Racket
+executions, plus 512 deterministic Python stress episodes. Native qualification
+passed both settings at seeds 0 and 17 with 40 protected-Racket executions. The
+required causal chain is: (A) segment same-color 4-connected components and
+classify each input-derived bounding-box corner; (intermediate) retain cells,
+color, bounding box, and corner label; (B) use that label and episode direction
+to select and apply the adjacent-corner translation. Relabeling the witness's
+TL singleton as TR changes two final cells under protected Racket; the owner-format
+witness status is `reviewer_replayed`.
